%% ============================================
%% FRONTISPIECE - "全書一句話" built on Jeremiah 31:28: the same watching,
%% first to pluck up, then to build and to plant.
%% ============================================
\thispagestyle{empty}
\begin{center}
\vspace*{0.3in}

\begin{tikzpicture}
  \draw[ScriptureGold, line width=0.8pt] (-2.8,0) -- (-0.55,0);
  \fill[ScriptureGold] (0,0) circle (0.055);
  \draw[ScriptureGold, line width=0.8pt] (0.55,0) -- (2.8,0);
\end{tikzpicture}

\vspace{0.22cm}
{\Large\bfseries\color{ChapterStone} 全書一句話 \textperiodcentered\ The Whole Book in One Verse}

\vspace{0.30cm}
\fcolorbox{ScriptureGold}{ScriptureBg}{%
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\centering\vspace{0.2cm}
\normalsize\color{CommentaryBrown}
我先前怎樣留意將他們拔出、拆毀、毀壞、傾覆、苦害，也必照樣\textbf{\color{AshClay!80!black}留意將他們建立、栽植}。\\[0.5em]
\footnotesize\itshape
As I have watched over them to pluck up, to break down, to overthrow, to destroy and
to bring disaster, so I will \textbf{watch over them to build and to plant}.\\[0.4em]
\small\color{ChapterStone} 耶利米書 31:28 \textperiodcentered\ Jeremiah 31:28
\vspace{0.2cm}
\end{minipage}}

\vspace{0.35cm}
{\small\color{TextGray} 五十二章經文 \textperiodcentered\ 二十七篇研讀 \textperiodcentered\ 六卷 \textperiodcentered\ 話先於人，審判裏種下新約\\
\textit{Fifty-two chapters of Jeremiah in twenty-seven studies \textperiodcentered\ six volumes \textperiodcentered\ The word comes first; the covenant is planted inside the judgment}}

\vspace{0.30cm}
{\small
\renewcommand{\arraystretch}{1.3}
\begin{tabular}{@{}p{3.5cm}p{1.9cm}p{6.7cm}@{}}
\toprule
\textbf{卷} & \textbf{研讀篇} & \textbf{在全書的展開} \\
\midrule
卷一：呼召與控訴 & 1-4篇 & 話先於人；先呼喚、後審判 \\
卷二：殿與不聽 & 5-11篇 & 殿裏的講道；代求被關上，眼淚沒有關 \\
卷三：君王與假先知 & 12-16篇 & 君王倒下；假平安；寫給被擄者的信 \\
卷四：安慰之書 & 17-19篇 & 新約；圍城中買田 \\
卷五：話語與焚燒 & 20-24篇 & 書卷被小刀割、被火燒，再寫、再添 \\
卷六：列國與終局 & 25-27篇 & 審判者亦受審；約雅斤得飯食 \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
}

\vspace{0.4cm}
\textcolor{ScriptureGold}{\rule{2.5in}{0.7pt}}
\vspace{0.3cm}

{\bfseries\color{ChapterStone} 讀經之鑰 \textperiodcentered\ How to Read This Book}

\vspace{0.18cm}
\begin{minipage}{4.6in}
\small\color{TextGray}
不是來讀一部亡國的預言，是來看神怎樣先說話、先流淚、先留後路。\\
同一個「留意」，先用來拔出，後用來栽植；書以一個坐在王席上的被擄之君作結。\\[0.5em]
\textit{\footnotesize
Not a chronicle of doom: God speaks first, weeps first, and leaves a way first. The same
watching that plucks up is the watching that plants; the book ends with an exiled king at a table.}
\end{minipage}

\vfill
{\scriptsize\color{LightGray} PubHub 三書精讀系統 \textperiodcentered\ Soli Deo Gloria}

